{"title":"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_8\">Problem 8</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 8\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/1/21178f4cb1b832bedf30cbf98b2464b0640c75f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\neq y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" /> and the sequences <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/8/758c654d9f323b259b896393d92793190a45476f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,a_1,a_2,y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"78\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/8/9a8c8ceeafd69d29e1d6577974d3c480b24dba80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,b_1,b_2,b_3,y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"97\" height=\"16\" /> each are in arithmetic progression, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/6/fd6f8af56ea817b0727da6f715362fc6bbb60989.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_2-a_1)/(b_2-b_1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/b/29baf18aa6c08d9dd887110ceb111f8c37c81d4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\frac{2}{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }\\frac{3}{4}\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }1\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\frac{4}{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"367\" height=\"38\" />  \n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>WLOG, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/2/892a6b6aa8af22beff3157e1cfebc22de9b7b27a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x =2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/9/889f56ce08684be3b2ab9914892de17686ae9594.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />. From the first sequence, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/9/949877e06e49100198e46b1c662a9f0e46395fb5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2, 3, 4, 5\\]\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/f/00f44ab02df5e6aa8385c0e86dfe3b96a3aec8e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2 - a_1 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"88\" height=\"14\" />\nFrom the second sequence, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/1/ba16a90006b31ed1d4e3140a6c987db94e5199ed.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2, 2+r, 2+2r, 2+3r, 5\\]\" width=\"184\" height=\"16\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/1/a615bca6274dce8e3c61736d97186f5a57088406.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+4r = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/6/b06162ef4a193b84be6dad1629621a9f16ca47ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"44\" height=\"38\" />\nThus, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/4/a6480f242a146a65f56ea211cef3e59e03b24456.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2, 2 \\frac{3}{4}, 3 \\frac{1}{2} ...\\]\" width=\"82\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/5/32592823469c4fd09175ebb74a5af86ed0b5ad1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_2 - b_1 = \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"38\" />\nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/5/5c57b607eb2f53ac0424741357babaa611c837c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{\\frac{3}{4}} = \\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"50\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/d/dadc8e71363a80c53a137421994b9e02de6eeabd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{D}\\]\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>~JustinLee2017\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME\" title=\"1978 AHSME\">1978 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1978 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1978\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wik